        "reference": "3 Nephi 7:7",
        "book": "3 Nephi",
        "chapter": 7,
        "verse": 7
      },
      {
        "text": "And thus six years had not passed away since the more part of the people had turned from their righteousness, like the dog to his vomit, or like the sow to her wallowing in the mire.",
